OL,3,GNEWSACouncil review finds misogyny and
OL,4,Abullying culture
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment inspectors have found
OL,7,Fevidence of a bullying and misogynistic
OL,8,Fculture across political groups at
OL,9,FBedford Borough Council.
OL,11,FIt found a blame culture within the
OL,12,Forganisation and accused Conservative
OL,13,FMayor Tom Wootton of "avoiding
OL,14,Fdifficult decisions and conflict".
OL,16,FWootton said: "I understand the
OL,17,Ffindings will concern residents and I
OL,18,Ftake them extremely seriously. I am
OL,19,Fdetermined to see this work through and
OL,20,Fbuild a council residents can have
OL,21,Fconfidence in, and be proud of."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
